Logo Visual Anchors
To capture immediate professional credibility with enterprise B2B buyers, your logo should balance financial stability with algorithmic movement.
The Graphic: A minimalist, continuous geometric icon showing a geometric document page wrapping into a continuous mathematical infinity loop or an ascending financial bar node.
The Typography: Clean, bold, sans-serif font for the "Docu" portion to establish clarity, paired with an ultra-modern, lighter weight tech-font for the "Fi" suffix.
The Palette: Use a base of deep obsidian dark grey (#1A1A24) for corporate trust, accented with a vibrant neon cyan/emerald gradient (#00E676) to signal real-time transaction processing.
